OL,3,GNEWSAPark cordoned off after woman's
OL,4,Abody found
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a woman has been found in
OL,7,FStanley Park in Liverpool.
OL,9,FOfficers were called at about 17:25 BST
OL,10,Fon Friday after a member of the public
OL,11,Fcontacted Merseyside Police.
OL,13,FThe force said it was working to
OL,14,Fidentify the woman and was treating her
OL,15,Fdeath as unexplained. A cordon was put
OL,16,Fin place around the park while CCTV and
OL,17,Fwitness inquiries were carried out.
OL,19,FPolice said a Home Office post-mortem
OL,20,Fexamination was due to take place to
OL,21,Festablish the cause of death.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
